  "appColorTheme": "App color",
  "sourcesAndCreditsDetails": "• Holy Quran Text: Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net) authentic text in Uthmani script under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0 — modification strictly prohibited).\n• Open-Source Quranic Typography: Scheherazade New, Noto Naskh Arabic, Harmattan, Lateef, and Amiri Quran (AmiriQuran & Amiri) under SIL Open Font License 1.1.\n• Quran Vocabulary Lexicon: Quranic Encyclopedia (Quranpedia.net — release 2026-10-10) and classical & modern Arabic dictionaries (Lisan al-Arab, Maqayis al-Lughah, Al-Tibyan, Tadhkirat al-Arib, Mufradat al-Raghib, and Al-Mu'jam al-Wasit).\n• Contemplation Books & Pamphlets Library: Lessons from the Guidance of the Holy Quran by Sayyed Hussein Badreddin al-Houthi (86 documented pamphlets), classical Ahlulbayt heritage & supplications (Al-Sahifah al-Sajjadiyah, Risalat al-Huquq, Nahj al-Balagha, Tuhaf al-Uqul), and Quranic sciences treatises (Al-Ajurri, Al-Nawawi).\n• Supplications, Adhkar & Tasbeeh: 88 Quranic duas arranged in Mushaf order, Hisn al-Muslim morning and evening adhkar, Tasbeeh & Istighfar sanctuary (49 authenticated formulas), and supplications from Ahlulbayt and the Noble Sunnah.\n• Application License: 100% free and open-source project licensed under the MIT License.\n• Madinah Mushaf script: page fonts (QCF) by the King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex, with line layout from Quran.com data.\n• Local Privacy & Security: Operates 100% offline with zero external connections, servers, tracking, or ads, featuring local AES-256 backup encryption.",
