  "tour1Title": "A blessed Book, sent down so they may reflect on its verses",
  "tour1Body": "Long-press any ayah to reflect on it, memorize it, listen to it or link it to others.",
  "tour2Title": "From reading to reflection",
  "tour2Body": "Four questions for each ayah open its meaning, and links gather ayahs around one theme.",
  "tour3Title": "Listen to great reciters",
  "tour3Body": "Play on through the surah or stop at one ayah, and download recitations to listen offline.",
  "tour4Title": "Your daily portion goes with you",
  "tour4Body": "A khatma plan, a daily streak, tasbeeh, and a widget that puts an ayah on your home screen.",
  "tour5Title": "Your companion on your Quran journey",
  "tour5Body": "Everything you need for reading, reflection and remembrance in one place, and it works offline.",
