  "guideQiblaTitle": "Qibla direction",
  "guideQiblaBody": "Set your location once, then hold the phone flat and turn it until the arrow points to the Kaaba.",
  "walkAyahTitle": "An ayah to reflect on",
  "walkAyahBody": "Fresh ayahs every day. Swipe between them and tap Reflect to write your pause.",
  "walkQuranTitle": "Your Mushaf and journey",
