  "guideReflections1Title": "Start from the ayah",
  "guideReflections1Body": "Long-press any ayah in the Mushaf, then choose “Reflection pause” in the middle of the menu.",
  "guideReflections2Title": "Four questions that open the meaning",
  "guideReflections2Body": "Answer what comes to you, even a word: what stopped you, what the ayah tells you, what it stirred in you, and what you will do with it today.",
  "guideReflections3Title": "Your pauses live here",
  "guideReflections3Body": "Every pause is kept in “My reflections”, and a lotus marks the ayah number in the Mushaf so you can return to it.",
  "guideLinks1Title": "A theme that gathers ayahs",
  "guideLinks1Body": "Create a link named after a theme you want to reflect on, like the doors of provision, patience or mercy.",
  "guideLinks2Title": "Ayahs joined by one meaning",
  "guideLinks2Body": "Add the verses of the theme, and write what you understood beside each one.",
  "guideLinks3Title": "See the whole picture",
  "guideLinks3Body": "View the link as a network to see how the ayahs complete each other, or as a list to read in order.",
  "guidePathways1Title": "A reflection journey, day by day",
  "guidePathways1Body": "Choose a pathway on a theme; each day brings one small step.",
  "guidePathways2Title": "Today’s ayah and its question",
  "guidePathways2Body": "Read the ayah slowly, then answer today’s question with what comes to you.",
  "guidePathways3Title": "Step after step",
  "guidePathways3Body": "Each day you finish lights up the next, and the app keeps your place so you can continue whenever you return.",
  "guideMushafTitle": "The Mushaf",
  "guideMushafBody": "Swipe to turn pages and long-press an ayah for its menu. Your marks for memorization, notes and reflections appear above the ayah number.",
  "guideMemorizationTitle": "Memorization and review",
  "guideMemorizationBody": "Add the ayahs you memorize and review what is due each day. What you master comes back less often; what you forget returns soon.",
  "guideWordMeaningsTitle": "Word meanings",
  "guideWordMeaningsBody": "Meanings of unusual words in Mushaf order. Search by word or meaning, or pick a surah to see it alone.",
  "guideNotesTitle": "Notes",
  "guideNotesBody": "Write a thought on an ayah or a general one, and export it as PDF or gather it into a reflection journal.",
  "guideSearchTitle": "Search",
  "guideSearchBody": "Search the Quran and everything you saved across 11 sections at once.",
  "guideBooksTitle": "Books and booklets",
  "guideBooksBody": "Read booklets and books inside the app, and pick up where you left off.",
  "guideDuasTitle": "Supplications",
  "guideDuasBody": "Duas from the Quran, the Sunnah and the Ahlulbayt, with daily adhkar and counters. Copy a dua or open it in the Mushaf.",
  "guideTasbeehTitle": "Tasbeeh and istighfar",
  "guideTasbeehBody": "Tap the circle to count and choose a target of 33 or 100. It can also count for you and move on to the next dhikr.",
  "guideJourneyTitle": "My journey and khatma",
  "guideJourneyBody": "Set a khatma plan that follows your reading position, and watch your streak and a map of what you have read.",
  "guideRemindersTitle": "Reminders",
  "guideRemindersBody": "Set a reminder for your portion or adhkar at a time that suits you; it arrives even when the app is closed.",
  "guideBackupTitle": "Backup",
  "guideBackupBody": "Export a password-encrypted copy of your data and keep it off the phone, to restore it if you change devices.",
